---
// Hero Section
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-bg-soft)]">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(0,168,157,0.08),_transparent_65%)]"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-32 left-12 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/14 blur-2xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -top-24 right-8 hidden h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 blur-3xl md:block"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div
        class="order-2 flex flex-col gap-8 text-center lg:order-1 lg:text-left"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/90 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--color-primary)] shadow-sm shadow-[var(--color-primary)]/10">
            Odontología empática · Manizales
          </span>
          <h1 class="text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-[var(--color-text-dark)] sm:text-[2.85rem]">
            Libera tu sonrisa y vuelve a sentirte invencible.
          </h1>
          <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-base text-[var(--color-text-muted)] sm:text-lg lg:mx-0">
            En una valoración de 45 minutos descubrimos qué te incomoda, diseñamos tu plan personalizado y resolvemos tus dudas con un lenguaje claro y sin juicios.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Odont%C3%B3loga+Mariana+Henao+Manizales"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--color-primary)]/30 bg-white/85 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] shadow-sm shadow-[var(--color-primary)]/10 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-[var(--color-primary)]/50 hover:text-[var(--color-primary-dark)]"
          >
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M10 0l2.39 6.92 7.11.63-5.2 4.68L16.18 20 10 16.45 3.82 20l1.38-7.77L0 7.55l7.61-.63L10 0z" />
            </svg>
            5.0 ★ en 180 reseñas verificadas
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center lg:justify-start">
          <a
            href="#contacto"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_20px_45px_-20px_rgba(0,168,157,0.9)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white sm:w-auto"
          >
            <svg
              class="h-5 w-5"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14" />
              <path d="M5 12h14" />
            </svg>
            Agenda tu valoración empática
          </a>
          <a
            href="#promesa"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--color-primary)] px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[var(--color-primary)] sm:w-auto"
          >
            <span>Ver protocolos de cuidado</span>
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 10h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              <path d="M10 5l5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Sin compromiso · Te respondemos por WhatsApp en menos de 15 minutos.</p>

        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/90 p-6 text-left shadow-[0_18px_46px_-36px_rgba(15,30,32,0.35)]">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--color-primary)]">+540 sonrisas sin ansiedad</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">El 98% de nuestras pacientes reportan cero dolor durante sus tratamientos.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/90 p-6 text-left shadow-[0_18px_46px_-36px_rgba(15,30,32,0.35)]">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--color-primary)]">Acompañamiento 1 a 1</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Te guiamos con simulaciones digitales y fotos clínicas en cada decisión.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="-mx-4 flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-4 overflow-x-auto px-4 pb-2 pt-2 sm:-mx-0 sm:flex-wrap sm:overflow-visible sm:px-0" role="list">
          {[
            {
              title: 'Diseños que honran tu esencia',
              description: 'Carillas y armonización digital con resultados 100% naturales.',
            },
            {
              title: 'Ambientes anti-estrés',
              description: 'Aromaterapia, música relajante y pausas conscientes durante cada cita.',
            },
            {
              title: 'Plan claro desde el día uno',
              description: 'Cronograma, inversión y garantías transparentes en un dossier digital.',
            },
          ].map((item, index) => (
            <div
              key={item.title}
              role="listitem"
              class="min-w-[250px] snap-center rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/90 px-6 py-5 text-left shadow-[0_16px_40px_-34px_rgba(15,30,32,0.32)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 sm:min-w-0 sm:flex-1"
              data-aos="fade-up"
              data-aos-delay={`${index * 120 + 200}`}
            >
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dark)]">{item.title}</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">{item.description}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm sm:max-w-md lg:max-w-lg">
          <div class="absolute -inset-6 rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--color-primary)]/15 via-white to-[var(--color-accent)]/10 blur-lg"></div>
          <figure class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[3rem] border border-white/70 bg-white shadow-[0_34px_80px_-48px_rgba(0,59,56,0.65)]">
            <img
              src="/images/Fotos/DSC02488.jpg"
              alt="Mariana Henao sonriendo con calidez"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
              fetchpriority="high"
              sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 520px, (min-width: 640px) 60vw, 88vw"
            />
          </figure>

          <div class="pointer-events-auto absolute -bottom-12 left-1/2 hidden w-[85%] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-3xl border border-white/70 bg-white/95 p-6 shadow-[0_26px_60px_-38px_rgba(15,30,32,0.45)] backdrop-blur lg:flex lg:flex-col lg:gap-2">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dark)]">Ruta empática comprobada</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Pacientes reales avalan la experiencia en Google y Doctoralia con calificación perfecta.</p>
            <a
              href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Odont%C3%B3loga+Mariana+Henao+Manizales"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-[var(--color-primary-dark)]"
            >
              Leer reseñas
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 10h10" />
                <path d="M10 5l5 5-5 5" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute -top-10 right-4 hidden rounded-3xl bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-5 py-4 text-left text-white shadow-[0_20px_40px_-28px_rgba(0,168,157,0.8)] sm:block">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/70">12 años</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold">Transformando sonrisas con empatía.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/90 px-5 py-4 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-34px_rgba(15,30,32,0.32)]">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dark)]">5.0 ★ en reseñas reales</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Google · Doctoralia · Instagram</p>
            </div>
            <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-[var(--color-primary)]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 17l-5 3 1.5-5.5L4 10l5.6-.4L12 4l2.4 5.6L20 10l-4.5 4.5L17 20z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-5 py-4 text-white shadow-[0_20px_45px_-30px_rgba(0,168,157,0.85)]">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-white/70">12 años</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold">Transformando sonrisas con empatía.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
